ession. These sources define her appearance rather than a frozen action.\n<Subject 2> is the autumn woodland stream and weathered wooden bridge abstracted from <Picture 1>. Preserve the bridge direction, plank texture, quiet water, red-orange foliage, and warm evening light as one coherent location.\n<Subject 3> is the outfit worn by <Subject 1>, abstracted from <Picture 1>: a mustard-yellow raincoat with its hood down, dark navy trousers, and cream sneakers. It supplies clothing appearance, without copying a product-display layout.\n<Subject 4> is the single small brass lantern abstracted from <Picture 1>, with a curved handle and a softly glowing warm light. It is the object carried and raised by <Subject 1>.\n<Subject 5> is the muted teal canvas crossbody bag abstracted from <Picture 1>, with its established strap, shape, and position against the woman's body.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] Generate one approximately 5.17-second, 16:9 live-action shot using 1 image reference. <Subject 1>, wearing <Subject 3> and carrying <Subject 5>, takes two small steps to screen right on <Subject 2> and raises <Subject 4> from thigh level to chest height. The images guide appearance and environment rather than enforce exact first or last frames.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - retain the same adult woman, facial identity, chin-length black bob, and natural body proportions while allowing the specified walking and arm movement.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - retain the bridge, stream, autumn foliage, spatial layout, wooden surface, and evening illumination; do not reproduce separate reference-image layouts as a collage.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - retain the yellow raincoat, navy trousers, cream sneakers, and hood-down configuration on the same woman.\n<Subject 4> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - retain one brass lantern with its handle and continuous warm glow, allowing only its carried position to change.\n<Subject 5> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - retain the same teal bag and crossbody strap; permit only slight natural sway during the two steps.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video uses realistic live-action cinematography, soft warm evening light, and natural autumn colors. The entire action takes place in one continuous shot, with no montage or change of location.\n[Shot 1] A medium-wide view establishes <Subject 2>, the weathered wooden bridge crossing a quiet woodland stream. Red-orange leaves frame the background, and the wooden planks recede consistently toward the far end. <Subject 1>, the adult woman with a chin-length black bob, stands in the left third of the frame, wearing <Subject 3>, the mustard-yellow raincoat, navy trousers, and cream sneakers. <Subject 5>, her muted teal bag, rests naturally against her side. She holds the curved handle of <Subject 4>, the single glowing brass lantern, beside her thigh. Her face is relaxed, her mouth is closed, and her eyes look gently along the bridge rather than toward the lens. The camera holds a static shot at a fixed height and angle. The lens does not zoom, pan, or orbit, and enough margin remains around her feet and the lantern throughout the action.\nFor roughly the first 0.60 seconds she remains balanced in this starting position, with a small natural breath and a faint movement of the raincoat hem. From about 0.60 to 2.60 seconds she takes exactly two short, unhurried steps toward screen right. The first foot lands before the next step begins; each shoe makes one soft wooden footfall at contact. Her feet stay on the bridge planks without skating, her shoulders remain level, and the bag strap moves only slightly. The lantern hangs below her hand and makes a small believable sway while its warm light remains steady.\nFrom about 2.60 to 4.30 seconds she stops walking, settles her weight, bends the elbow of the lantern-holding arm, and smoothly raises the same lantern from thigh level to chest height. Her grip remains around the existing handle, her wrist follows the upward arc, and her free hand rests naturally near the bag. She glances briefly toward the warm glow and develops a small, relaxed smile without opening her mouth. From 4.30 seconds to the end she holds this chest-height lantern pose nearer the center of the frame, allowing the fabric and bag to settle.\nSoft stream noise and light wind remain audible throughout. The two quiet footfalls coincide with the two contacts, and a faint clothing rustle accompanies the arm movement. The bridge geometry, stream position, trees, and lighting remain consistent across the shot. Keep one woman, one bag, and one lantern in a single full-width image, with no extra people, split screen, captions, logos, or watermarks. There is no dialogue or singing.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nA gentle stream and soft woodland wind continue throughout the shot. Two quiet wooden footfalls and a faint raincoat rustle follow the visible movement. There are no human vocal sounds.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A\n\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "六段提示词 · 图1场景 / 图2人物 / 图3–9占位", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [640, 1050], "pos": [1060, 330], "id": 238, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.33.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 16}, {"outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [510], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "FLOAT"}], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": [5], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveFloat", "title": "视频时长（秒）", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [300, 90], "pos": [1400, 20], "id": 227, "propert